## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a controller with CRD, DAG-based scheduling, and multi-tenant enforcement.

## Key Concepts
- Kubernetes CRD and controller-runtime
- Concurrency limits, CPU quotas, timeouts
- DAG modeling and dependency resolution
- Safe enforcement: pausing, canceling, finalizers
- Observability and RBAC/drift testing

